            "review_title": "Review at Tokyo Yukai",
            "review_text": "Xanerin\nAlice Springs, Australia1494 contributions\n0\nFood Galore\nDec 2017 • Couples\nWhat a fantastic restaurant on the top floor of the Vincom Shopping Complex. You select what food you want and you can cook it yourself or they they will come table a cook for you. Fresh and delicious. All you can eat, and I mean all you can eat! Steak, pork, chicken, seafood, salad and more. Even when we were filled, they asked if we wanted more! Probably one of our best meals yet. (Cost was 339,000 vn each. Approx $25 each).\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 28, 2017",
